{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1426784-november-m20-update","id":1426784,"title":"November M20 Update!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-30T19:28:43-08:00","id":1426784,"title":"November M20 Update!","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-mage-the-ascension-20th-anniversary-edition/posts/3037264\" target=\"_blank\">According to Rich Thomas;</a> Development<ul><li>M20 Rich Bastard's Guide To Magic</li> </ul><br /> Editing<ul><li>M20 Victorian Mage</li> <li>M20 Technocracy Operative\u2019s Dossier</li> </ul><br /> Art Direction<ul><li>M20 Victorian Mage: ADing rolling. Some splats and scenes contracted for the Kickstarter already. Sending out Victorian reference material.</li> <li>M20 Technocracy Jumpstart</li> </ul><br /> Layout<ul><li>M20 The Technocracy Reloaded</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-30T20:15:39-08:00","id":1426788,"title":"","content":"Aren't you supposed to have a jumpstart/quick start out before you release the main product?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-30T20:28:06-08:00","id":1426791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1426784-november-m20-update?p=1426788#post1426788\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aren't you supposed to have a jumpstart/quick start out before you release the main product?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, not necessarily. Happens all the time where the corebook comes out before the jumpstart. Although doesn't look like it's necessarily from deliberate intent, just the way how the workflow and schedule plays out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-30T21:05:14-08:00","id":1426795,"title":"","content":"The M20 Technocracy Jumpstart is also a stretch goal. There was a substantial amount of text and art from the main Technocracy Reloaded tome released to backers during the Kickstarter--the work was substantially complete on a solid draft at the time of the Kickstarter.<br /> <br /> There's also a lot less art required in a Jumpstart than a full core book, so they might finish at the same time.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-01T04:39:05-08:00","id":1426814,"title":"","content":"Awesome. Now the stuff only needs to get a translation to german. In the DACHL region we still have only the core rulebook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}